WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.055
Boo! Don't be scared…

00:00:02.105 --> 00:00:06.030
The only frightening thing is missing this job fair.

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:12.361
Join Precision Parcel &amp; Package Deliveries for our Peak Season Job Fair.

00:00:12.411 --> 00:00:16.660
Saturday, October 31, 9:00 a.m. to 3:30 p.m. in Oakville.

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:22.882
We're hiring final mile contract drivers in Ontario and Manitoba.

00:00:22.932 --> 00:00:27.140
Cargo vans, minivans and SUVs. You bring the wheels.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:33.073
Meet our Recruiting Manager and an Operations Manager. Tour the terminal.

00:00:33.123 --> 00:00:36.590
Bring your documents and get onboarded on the spot.

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:43.084
Bring digital copies of your licence, a second photo ID, your driver's abstract,

00:00:43.134 --> 00:00:46.790
$2 million liability insurance and vehicle ownership.

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:52.453
Walk-ins are welcome! Save your spot at driveprecision.ca.

00:00:52.503 --> 00:00:53.520
…If you dare.
